.TH geectl-pull-request-comments 1  "geectl-pull-request-comments 0.2.3" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-pull\-request\-comments \- List the comments on a pull request, oldest first. A read, always live
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl pull\-request comments\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREFERENCE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List the comments on a pull request, oldest first. A read, always live
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREFERENCE\fR>
The pull\-request handle: `obs:<id>` or `gitea:<owner>/<repo>#<number>`
.SH VERSION
v0.2.3
